00:18:13,091 --> 00:18:22,173
[SPEAKER_00]: So, Paul, I mean, yeah, well, everyone, you don't have to go and try and let everyone abandon you.

239
00:18:23,034 --> 00:18:24,014
[SPEAKER_01]: No, no, of course not.

240
00:18:24,094 --> 00:18:30,295
