469
00:36:27,052 --> 00:36:27,352
[SPEAKER_01]: Why?

470
00:36:27,873 --> 00:36:32,595
[SPEAKER_01]: Because whatever he would have done while the fear was present, it would have been rooted in the fear.

471
00:36:33,233 --> 00:36:34,194
