497
00:38:06,499 --> 00:38:09,141
[SPEAKER_01]: So, then he said, well, still don't do it.

498
00:38:09,161 --> 00:38:15,246
[SPEAKER_01]: The the intention was wholesome, but externally, the vinaya, don't do it, because other people will not be able to do it.

499
00:38:15,286 --> 00:38:26,694
[SPEAKER_00]: But the thing is, of course, to point out that people can, people, petrugians, can praise and blame you for just about anything with that, but praise and blame

