00:40:29,278 --> 00:40:33,862
[SPEAKER_01]: You won't become a victim, then, of sort of developing, oh, no, this is what's right, this is what's wrong.

534
00:40:34,322 --> 00:40:40,327
[SPEAKER_01]: And then, convince yourself that you, as a pūtugina, know what right is, and what wrong is.

535
00:40:40,948 --> 00:40:43,390
