536
00:40:44,130 --> 00:40:49,215
[SPEAKER_01]: The description of sotāpanna in the suttas is, he knows right as right, and wrong as wrong.

537
00:40:50,616 --> 00:40:56,781
[SPEAKER_01]: So, if somebody who knows that he's not a sotāpanna says, no, this is right, and believes that, he's just blocking his own development.

